225 594 1013 (                       ing, the utility is setup for execution) 1013 SB
225 653 881 (                       with SID, and responds with:) 881 SB
225 712 688 (                              .INITIAL = iiii) 688 SB
225 771 782 (                              .COLLECT  = cccc) 782 SB
225 831 726 (                              .DISPLAY dddd) 726 SB
225 890 1113 (                       where iiii, cccc, and dddd are three abso-) 1113 SB
225 949 1005 (                       lute address entries to the utility for) 1005 SB
225 1008 1122 (                       \(re\)initializing, collecting debug data, and) 1122 SB
225 1067 1102 (                       displaying collected information, respec-) 1102 SB
225 1126 1069 (                       tively.   The SID symbol table contains) 1069 SB
225 1186 1010 (                       these three entry names.  A utility is) 1010 SB
225 1245 739 (                       reinitialized by typing:) 739 SB
225 1304 847 (                                Ciiii or     C.INITIAL) 847 SB
225 1363 1057 (                       The display information is obtained by) 1057 SB
225 1422 437 (                       typing:) 437 SB
225 1481 978 (                                Cdddd      or    C.DISPLAY) 978 SB
225 1541 1122 (                       while data collection occurs during moni-) 1122 SB
225 1600 1065 (                       tored execution using the T or U com-) 1065 SB
225 1659 1113 (                       mands, where the second argument gives) 1113 SB
225 1718 1003 (                       the collection address. xamples are:) 1003 SB
