225 1600 1019 (                    Notable differences between MACand) 1019 SB
225 1659 1090 (                    the SID "A" command are that no pseudo) 1090 SB
225 1718 1084 (                    operations are allowed, operands are SID) 1084 SB
225 1777 1044 (                    symbolic expressions*, labels cannot be) 1044 SB
225 1836 1058 (                    inserted, and register references must be) 1058 SB
225 1896 669 (                    names, not numbers.) 669 SB
225 2014 730 (                    *In particular, note that) 730 SB
225 2073 675 (                                    LXI H,'ab') 675 SB
225 2132 1023 (                    fills H with 'a' and L with 'b' due to the) 1023 SB
225 2191 1090 (                    nature of SID expressions, which is coun-) 1090 SB
225 2251 812 (                    ter to the MAC convention.) 812 SB
